@startuml
title UC-1 Stage Backbone을 생성한다
caption Product Spec: UC-1, G-1, G-2, BR-1..BR-5
left to right direction
actor "Stage Generation AI" as Generator
actor "Storybook RAG" as RAG
actor "Adventure Runtime" as Runtime
usecase "Scenario Source 조회" as Evidence
usecase "얕은 Stage Backbone 생성" as Backbone
usecase "핵심 갈등·Finale 방향 보존" as Core
usecase "근거·출처 검증" as Validate
Generator --> Backbone
RAG --> Evidence
Backbone .> Evidence : <<include>>
Backbone .> Core : <<include>>
Backbone .> Validate : <<include>>
Runtime --> Backbone : 현재 리비전 사용
note right of Backbone
전체 미래의 상세 사건 순서는
생성하지 않는다.
end note
@enduml
